  {
   "settings": {
    "dialog": [
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "This darn mine... ",
       "transl": "Diese verfluchte Mine..."
      }
     },
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "Ancients almost killed me with their stupid track. ",
       "transl": "Die Ahnen mit ihrem doofen Pfad haben mich fast alle gemacht."
      }
     },
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "'Tis a shame indeed.",
       "transl": "Traurig, aber wahr."
      }
     },
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "Yea, everything in there is consumed by them machines and whatnot.",
       "transl": "Ach, da drinne' wird einfach alles von den ihre Maschinen und was weiß ich nich' alles verbraten."
      }
     },
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "You were there when it happened right?",
       "transl": "Du warst doch dabei, als es passierte, ne?"
      }
     },
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "I sure was. Still have \\c[5]nightmares\\c[0] about that scream.",
       "transl": "Und wie ich dabei war. Ich habe immer noch \\c[5]Alpträume\\c[0] von diesem Schrei."
      },
      "event": [
       {
        "person": {
         "person": "rookie-harbor.man-big-red",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "You're interested, lass?",
         "transl": "Na, Kurze, hasse lange Ohren gekriegt?"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "rookie-harbor.man-big-red",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "[nods]",
         "transl": "[киває]"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "NOD"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "The mine in the north was our biggest one.",
         "transl": "Unsere größte Mine war die im Norden."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "rookie-harbor.man-big-red",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "We used to mine for rare ores there. ",
         "transl": "Wir haben dort nach seltenen Erzen gesucht."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "rookie-harbor.man-big-red",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "One day however, there was the most awful sound from the depths of the mine.",
         "transl": "Eines Tages jedoch hörte man das schrecklichste aller Geräusche aus den Tiefen der Mine."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "rookie-harbor.man-big-red",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "After that, all the robots we used turned on us. ",
         "transl": "Danach wandten sich alle Roboter, die wir hatten, gegen uns. "
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "rookie-harbor.man-big-red",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "No one really knows what happened. But we assume it has something to do with the temple we discovered.",
         "transl": "Niemand weiß wirklich, was passiert ist. Wir nehmen aber an, dass es etwas mit dem Tempel zu tun hatte, den wir entdeckt haben."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "rookie-harbor.man-big-red",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Apparently it's some old ruin left by these \\c[3]Ancients\\c[0].",
         "transl": "Ist anscheinend so 'ne alte Ruine, die von diesen \\c[3]Ahnen\\c[0] zurückgelassen wurde."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "rookie-harbor.man-big-red",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "...",
         "transl": "..."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "SURPRISED_TOWARD"
        }
       }
      ]
     }
